 around the world, reading biology books, and diving to take underwater pictures of fish.",{"children":"I was born and raised in Spain but I moved to California to get my bachelors degree. Right now I am a senior undergraduate student majoring in Biology. After I graduate, I want to pursue a Masters degree to deepen my knowledge so I can  contribute to advances in scientific knowledge and improve human health. In my free time, I love walking in nature, visiting aquariums from all around the world, reading biology books, and diving to take underwater pictures of fish."}]]]}]]}],["$","footer",null,{"className":"footer","id":"contact","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/kimmeylab/logo/ucsc logo.png","alt":"UC Santa Cruz"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Kimmey Lab"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Department of Microbiology and Environmental Toxicology"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Biomedical Sciences, UC Santa Cruz"}]]}]]}]]}]
